{"run_id": "run_2fc79adc1040", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_012", "task_id": "sample_upload_task", "scenario_id": "s12_faq_cost", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "user", "content": "您好，请问现在方便接听吗？这边通知您一个发票功能更新。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "agent", "content": "方便，你说吧。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "user", "content": "好的，新版发票开具入口已经上线了，更容易查找，还支持历史记录查看。"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "agent", "content": "这个会不会更贵？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "user", "content": "根据FAQ，功能更新不会额外收费，您可以放心使用。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "agent", "content": "那成本方面呢？会不会增加我的成本？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "user", "content": "成本没有变化，具体您可以查看帮助中心或预约回访详细了解。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我明白了，谢谢。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "user", "content": "不客气，后续如有问题可查看帮助中心或预约回访，再见。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 4, "tool_name": "query_faq", "arguments": {"task_id": "sample_upload_task", "question": "这个会不会更贵？"}, "result": {}, "latency_ms": 0, "error_code": null}, {"turn": 6, "tool_name": "update_task_status", "arguments": {"task_id": "sample_upload_task", "status": "faq_answered"}, "result": {}, "latency_ms": 0, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_2fc79adc1040", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_013", "task_id": "sample_upload_task", "scenario_id": "s13_faq_diff", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "user", "content": "您好，请问现在方便接听吗？这边通知您一个发票功能更新。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "agent", "content": "方便的，请说。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "user", "content": "好的，新版发票开具入口已经上线了，更容易查找，还支持历史记录查看。"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "agent", "content": "那和旧版有什么区别？比如两种模式规则有什么不同？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我帮您查一下。新版入口更集中，历史记录可追溯；旧版分散。具体模式区别我查一下FAQ。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，麻烦您了。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "user", "content": "根据FAQ，两种模式主要区别：1. 新版自动汇总历史发票，旧版需手动查找；2. 新版支持批量操作，旧版单张处理。适用场景：新版适合频繁开票商家，旧版适合偶尔开票。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "agent", "content": "明白了，那新版更适合我们。如果后续有问题，可以看帮助中心或预约回访吗？"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "user", "content": "是的，您可以在帮助中心搜索，或我帮您预约回访。请问需要预约吗？"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "agent", "content": "暂时不需要，谢谢。我清楚了。"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "user", "content": "好的，那就不打扰您了。祝您生意兴隆，再见！"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 5, "tool_name": "query_faq", "arguments": {"task_id": "sample_upload_task", "question": "模式区别"}, "result": {}, "latency_ms": 0, "error_code": null}, {"turn": 7, "tool_name": "update_task_status", "arguments": {"task_id": "sample_upload_task", "status": "faq_answered"}, "result": {}, "latency_ms": 0, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "in_progre